---
<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div data-reveal class="head">
      <div class="eyebrow">Who we help</div>
      <h2>Two audiences, one standard of care.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      <div data-reveal class="card">
        <div class="tag">For Companies</div>
        <h3>Hire your next senior leader.</h3>
        <p>You need a search partner who moves like part of your team — executive search, embedded recruiting, fractional support, and talent strategy.</p>
        <a href="/companies" class="link">Explore for companies →</a>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal class="card">
        <div class="tag">For Senior Leaders</div>
        <h3>Build the relationship first.</h3>
        <p>You're a VP, Director, or executive exploring what's next — confidentially, on your timeline, before you're actively looking.</p>
        <a href="/leaders" class="link">Explore for leaders →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .band { background: var(--bg-elevated); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .wrap { max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(64px, 9vw, 112px) clamp(20px, 5vw, 48px); }
  .head { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 56px; }
  .eyebrow { font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent-solid); margin-bottom: 16px; }
  h2 { font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque", sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px); letter-spacing: -.02em; margin: 0; }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
  .card { background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 20px; padding: 44px; }
  .tag { font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-tertiary); margin-bottom: 18px; }
  h3 { font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque", sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; margin: 0 0 16px; letter-spacing: -.015em; }
  .card p { font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0 0 28px; }
  .link { color: var(--accent-solid); font-weight: 600; font-size: 14.5px; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .wrap { padding: 60px 20px; }
    .head { margin-bottom: 36px; }
    .eyebrow { font-size: 10px; }
    h2 { max-width: 14ch; margin-inline: auto; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.15; }
    .grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
    .card { min-width: 0; padding: 28px 24px; border-radius: 16px; }
    .tag { margin-bottom: 14px; font-size: 10px; }
    h3 { font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2; }
    .card p { margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 15px; }
  }
</style>
